data: {"id": "e7550de3ed05412b-thinking-parallel_evidence-762", "run_id": "e7550de3ed05412b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "证据采集已完成。以下是本轮已确认的事实、冲突和缺口总结：\n\n---\n\n## 证据结论\n\n### ✅ 已确认事实（支持候选原因）\n\n1. **Pod 仍为 Pending 状态**：`kubectl_describe` 和 `kubectl_get_yaml` 均确认 `phase: Pending`，`nodeName: None`，`PodScheduled: False`。\n2. **FailedScheduling 事件明确原因**：调度器报告 `\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"`，发生时间 35 分钟前及 24 分钟前（重复触发）。\n3. **根因：NodeSelector 无法匹配任何节点**：Pod 的 `nodeSelector` 为 `{\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`，而集群 3 个节点（master、node1、node2）的标签中 **均不存在 `aiops.lab/unavailable` 这个 key**", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788762428238, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

