data: {"id": "e7550de3ed05412b-final", "run_id": "e7550de3ed05412b", "seq": 767, "ts_ms": 1788762444353, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52 处于 Pending 状态，持续 FailedScheduling |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | default-scheduler | `Warning FailedScheduling 35m... 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 明确记录调度失败原因，指出节点亲和性/选择器不匹配导致 0/3 节点可用。 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | pod.spec | `nodeSelector: {aiops.lab/unavailable: true}` | 提供具体的亲和性约束配置，作为判定调度失败的理论依据。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubelet/k8s-api | `PodScheduled: False, reason: Unschedulable, message: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` | 状态层面的直接证据，证实 Pod 因调度条件不满足而卡在 Pending 状态。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"} = 1` | 指标确认 Pod 持续处于 Pending 阶段，无 Succeeded 记录。 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n事件（#1）与状态消息（#3）共同指向同一失败机制：调度器在评估 3 个节点时，均发现它们不满足 Pod 的亲和性约束。配置事实（#2）提供了该约束的具体内容（`aiops.lab/unavailable: true`）。指标数据（#4）从监控维度证实了该 Pod 持续无法进入运行状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置 nodeSelector {aiops.lab/unavailable: true} → 集群所有节点均缺少该标签 → 调度器判定 0/3 节点匹配 → Pod 持续 Pending 且未分配 nodeName\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod 的 `nodeSelector` 配置要求节点具有 `aiops.lab/unavailable: true` 标签，但集群中所有节点（3 个）均不满足此条件，导致调度器无法为 Pod 分配任何节点。\n\n**证据支撑**：\n- K8s 事件与状态消息均明确指出失败原因是 `node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` (#1, #3)；\n- Pod 配置事实显示其强制要求该特定标签 (#2)。\n\n该结论逻辑闭环完整，无需补充其他维度的证据。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 43.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52: 43.9s (Evidence 35.9s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 70.351, "metrics": {"run_id": "e7550de3ed05412b", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 70.35674452781677, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 70356.74452781677, "llm_calls": 19, "llm_duration_ms": 64389.970541000366, "tool_calls": 19, "executed_tool_calls": 16, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 11626.983165740967, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5559.5903396606445}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18402.023315429688, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 43860.098361968994, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8070.124387741089, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

